718 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Water is the lifeblood of agriculture\054 yet traditional farming practices continue to lose up to 40\045 of irrigation water to evaporation\054 surface runoff\054 and deep drainage\056 As global climate patterns become increasingly unpredictable\054 relying on scheduled irrigation or manual soil checks is no longer sustainable\056\n\nThe challenge for modern growers isn\047t just about applying water it\047s about applying the exact amount required at the absolute right moment\056 This is where precision agritech steps in\054 shifting the agricultural industry from traditional guesswork to high fidelity\054 automated intelligence\056)
     /K [ 9 ]
     /P 719 0 R
     /Pg 700 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

