730 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Beyond saving millions of gallons of water\054 automated precision farming directly impacts crop health\056 Over\055watering causes nutrient leaching a damaging process where vital fertilizers and minerals are washed deep into the water table\054 completely out of reach of plant roots\056\n\nBy maintaining a perfectly balanced moisture equilibrium\054 the soil structure remains intact\056 Micro\055irrigation preserves the natural aeration of the dirt\054 fostering a healthier microbiome environment\056 Crops grown under these precise conditions develop stronger\054 deeper root architectures\054 leading to uniform growth and highly predictable yields at harvest\056)
     /K [ 15 ]
     /P 731 0 R
     /Pg 700 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

