734 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The integration of IoT sensors and automated irrigation represents a fundamental shift in how the world approaches food security\056 It proves that resource conservation and commercial profitability can easily coexist\056\n\nBy implementing robust\054 data\055driven frameworks into daily operations\054 modern enterprises are protecting their local ecosystems while securing a more resilient\054 high\055yielding\054 and completely predictable future for global agriculture\056)
     /K [ 17 ]
     /P 735 0 R
     /Pg 700 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

